  "settings.tr.prefillDesc": "Models that think before answering can spend the whole budget on a single passage and return nothing. This tells the model its thinking is done and to start writing the translation. Keep it on for a server on your own machine; turn it off only if a cloud API rejects the request.",
  "settings.debugMode": "Debug mode",
  "settings.debugModeDesc": "Turns on the tools used to fix typesetting. While it is on, the reading toolbar gains a measuring-grid button that lays a colour ruler over the screen so margins and overflow can be read off as coordinates. It is not needed for reading.",
  "settings.displayDesc": "EPUBs often omit the vertical-writing declaration, so any book the automatic detection gets wrong can be overridden per book from the reader’s writing-direction menu. “As authored” turns off the image, spread and aspect corrections so you can see exactly what the EPUB specifies. Binding and spread here are the defaults for every book; changing them in the reader remembers the choice for that book alone.",
